완벽합니다. 이제 모든 필요한 정보를 수집했습니다. 최종 보고서를 작성하겠습니다.

## NINEONELABS WORKS 페이지 Hover-to-Video 구현 분석

### 1. **WorksPageRuntime.ts — WorksGridFeedRuntime 클래스의 Hover-to-Video 구현**

#### 그리드 아이템 생성 시 비디오 hover 처리 (라인 742-794)

```typescript
private _createListItem(item: WorkApiItem): HTMLLIElement {
  const listItem = document.createElement("li");
  listItem.className = "no-sub-works__gallery-item";
  listItem.dataset.workNo = item.no;

  const link = document.createElement("a");
  link.className = "no-sub-works__gallery-item__link";
  link.href = this._buildDetailHref(item.detailPath || "/works");

  const imageWrap = document.createElement("div");
  imageWrap.className = "no-sub-works__gallery-item__img-wrap";

  const imageInner = document.createElement("div");
  imageInner.className = "no-sub-works__gallery-item__img-inner";

  const figure = document.createElement("figure");
  figure.className = "no-sub-works__gallery-item__img";

  const media = this._createMedia(item);
  if (media) {
    figure.append(media);
  }

  if (item.thumbnailImage && item.thumbnailVideo) {
    this._attachVideoHover(listItem, item.thumbnailVideo, figure);
  }
  // ... 나머지 구조
}
```

#### Hover Video 런타임 구현 (라인 817-887)

```typescript
private _attachVideoHover(
  li: HTMLLIElement,
  videoUrl: string,
  figure: HTMLElement,
): void {
  const video = document.createElement("video");
  video.muted = true;
  video.loop = true;
  video.playsInline = true;
  video.preload = "none";
  figure.append(video);

  let isHovered = false;
  let pendingPlay: Promise<void> | null = null;

  const show = (): void => {
    if (isHovered) figure.classList.add("is-video-active");
  };

  const hideVideoNow = (): void => {
    figure.classList.remove("is-video-active");
  };

  const safePause = (): void => {
    video.pause();
    video.currentTime = 0;
  };

  const drainAndPause = (): void => {
    const p = pendingPlay;
    pendingPlay = null;
    if (p !== null) {
      void p.then(() => { if (!isHovered) safePause(); });
    } else {
      safePause();
    }
  };

  const onEnter = (): void => {
    isHovered = true;
    if (!video.src) {
      video.src = videoUrl;
      video.load();
    }
    pendingPlay = video.play().catch(() => undefined);
    if (video.readyState >= 3) {
      show();
    } else {
      video.addEventListener("canplay", show, { once: true });
    }
  };

  const onLeave = (): void => {
    isHovered = false;
    video.removeEventListener("canplay", show);
    hideVideoNow();
    drainAndPause();
  };

  li.addEventListener("pointerenter", onEnter);
  li.addEventListener("pointerleave", onLeave);

  this._videoHoverCleanups.push(() => {
    isHovered = false;
    video.removeEventListener("canplay", show);
    figure.classList.remove("is-video-active");
    drainAndPause();
    li.removeEventListener("pointerenter", onEnter);
    li.removeEventListener("pointerleave", onLeave);
  });
}
```

**핵심 특징:**
- `preload="none"` — 초기 로드 없음
- **Lazy load on hover** — `pointerenter` 시 `video.src` 설정 및 `load()` 호출
- **Promise 기반 play 관리** — `pendingPlay` 변수로 async play 상태 추적
- **Crossfade 효과** — CSS 클래스 `is-video-active` toggle으로 opacity 전환
- **Cleanup 추적** — `_videoHoverCleanups` 배열에 모든 이벤트 리스너 등록

---

### 2. **works.scene.ts — Fallback 상수**

```typescript
export const WORK_PLACEHOLDER_IMAGE =
  "/resource/images/placeholder/placeholder.jpg";
```

**위치:** `/resource/images/placeholder/placeholder.jpg`
- 산 이미지 로드 실패 시 사용되는 단일 fallback
- 비디오 관련 별도 fallback은 정의되지 않음

---

### 3. **views/pages/works/index.php — HTML 그리드 구조**

```php
<ul class="no-sub-works__gallery-list"></ul>
```

**Runtime에서 동적 생성되는 구조:**

```html
<li class="no-sub-works__gallery-item" data-work-no="<item.no>">
  <a class="no-sub-works__gallery-item__link" href="...">
    <div class="no-sub-works__gallery-item__img-wrap">
      <span class="no-sub-works__gallery-item__corner"></span>
      <div class="no-sub-works__gallery-item__img-inner">
        <figure class="no-sub-works__gallery-item__img">
          <!-- 썸네일 이미지 또는 비디오 -->
          <img src="item.thumbnailImage" alt="...">
          <!-- Hover video (첫 번째 자식이면 thumbnail img, 두 번째가 hover video) -->
          <video muted loop playsinline preload="none"></video>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="no-sub-works__gallery-item__body">
      <h2 class="no-sub-works__gallery-item__title">...</h2>
    </div>
  </a>
  <button class="no-corner-btn no-works-canvas__grid-link js-work-modal-trigger">
    ...
  </button>
</li>
```

**data 속성:** `data-work-no` — 프로젝트 ID 저장 (but data-video, data-thumbnail은 사용 안 함. 대신 런타임에 JS로 URL 주입)

---

### 4. **_sub.scss — Grid 비디오/이미지 스타일**

```scss
.no-sub-works__gallery-item__img {
  @include img-auto-cover(62.5%);

  img,
  video {
    @include img-cover;
    transition: transform var(--transition-default);
  }

  img {
    transition:
      transform var(--transition-default),
      opacity 0.35s ease;
  }

  video {
    @include pos-full();
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  &.is-video-active {
    img {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    video {
      opacity: 1;
      transition:
        transform var(--transition-default),
        opacity 0.35s ease;
    }
  }
}

&:not(:hover) &__img video {
  opacity: 0;
  transition: none;
}
```

**Crossfade 메커니즘:**
1. `video` 초기: `opacity: 0`, `pointer-events: none`
2. `.is-video-active` 추가 시:
   - `img` → `opacity: 0` (0.35s ease)
   - `video` → `opacity: 1` (0.35s ease)
3. `:not(:hover)` 상태 → 즉시 `opacity: 0`, `transition: none`

---

### 5. **Scatter 뷰의 Hover-to-Video — WorksSceneManager.ts**

```typescript
class WorksHoverVideoRuntime {
  private readonly _video: HTMLVideoElement;
  private _texture: THREE.CanvasTexture | null = null;
  private _alpha = 0;
  private _alphaTarget = 0;

  activate(
    mesh: THREE.Mesh,
    texture: THREE.CanvasTexture,
    videoUrl: string,
    proj: WorkProjectItem,
    size: WorkCardSize,
    staticImage: HTMLImageElement | null,
  ): void {
    this._texture = texture;
    this._proj = proj;
    this._size = size;
    this._staticImage = staticImage ?? null;
    this._alpha = 0;
    this._alphaTarget = 1;
    if (this._video.src !== videoUrl) {
      this._video.src = videoUrl;
      this._video.load();
    }
    void this._video.play().catch(() => undefined);
  }

  deactivate(): void {
    this._video.pause();
    this._alphaTarget = 0;
  }

  drawFrame(): void {
    if (!this._texture || !this._proj || !this._size) return;

    this._alpha += (this._alphaTarget - this._alpha) * 0.12;

    if (this._alphaTarget === 0 && this._alpha < 0.01) {
      // Fallback: 원본 이미지로 복귀
      WorkCard.updateTextureImage(
        this._texture,
        this._proj,
        this._size,
        this._staticImage ?? new Image(),
        SCATTER_CARD_RENDER_OPTIONS,
      );
      this._texture = null;
      return;
    }

    if (this._alpha > 0.99 && this._alphaTarget === 1) {
      // 비디오 프레임 직접 렌더링
      WorkCard.updateTextureVideoFrame(
        this._texture,
        this._proj,
        this._size,
        this._video,
        SCATTER_CARD_RENDER_OPTIONS,
      );
      return;
    }

    // Crossfade 진행 중
    WorkCard.updateTextureImage(
      this._texture,
      this._proj,
      this._size,
      this._staticImage ?? new Image(),
      SCATTER_CARD_RENDER_OPTIONS,
    );
    WorkCard.overlayVideoFrame(
      this._texture,
      this._size,
      this._video,
      this._alpha
    );
  }
}
```

**Scatter 뷰 Hover 업데이트 로직 (WorksSceneManager.update, 라인 670-697):**

```typescript
// Hover video: activate / deactivate when hovered mesh changes
if (this.hovered !== this._prevHovered) {
  if (this._prevHovered) this._hoverVideo.deactivate();
  if (this.hovered) {
    const userData = this.hovered.userData as WorkCardUserData;
    if (userData.proj.thumbnailVideo) {
      const material = this.hovered.material as THREE.MeshBasicMaterial;
      const texture = material.map;
      if (texture instanceof THREE.CanvasTexture) {
        this._hoverVideo.activate(
          this.hovered,
          texture,
          userData.proj.thumbnailVideo,
          userData.proj,
          this._cardSize,
          userData.loadedImage ?? null,
        );
      }
    }
  }
  this._prevHovered = this.hovered;
}
if (this._hoverVideo.isActive()) this._hoverVideo.drawFrame();
```

---

### 6. **WorkCard.ts — 비디오 프레임 렌더링**

#### updateTextureVideoFrame (라인 296-340)

```typescript
static updateTextureVideoFrame(
  texture: THREE.CanvasTexture,
  proj: WorkProjectItem,
  size: WorkCardSize,
  video: HTMLVideoElement,
  renderOptions: WorkCardRenderOptions = WORK_CARD_DEFAULT_RENDER_OPTIONS,
): void {
  if (video.readyState < 2) return; // HAVE_CURRENT_DATA 미만이면 skip
  const canvas = texture.image as HTMLCanvasElement;
  const ctx = canvas.getContext("2d");
  // ... canvas 초기화 및 비디오 frame 그리기
  drawTitleBar(ctx, proj, width, imageHeight, renderOptions);
  texture.needsUpdate = true;
}
```

#### overlayVideoFrame (라인 342-382) — Crossfade 오버레이

```typescript
static overlayVideoFrame(
  texture: THREE.CanvasTexture,
  size: WorkCardSize,
  video: HTMLVideoElement,
  alpha: number,
): void {
  if (video.readyState < 2) return;
  const canvas = texture.image as HTMLCanvasElement;
  const ctx = canvas.getContext("2d");
  // ... 비디오 프레임을 globalAlpha로 오버레이
  ctx.globalAlpha = alpha;
  ctx.drawImage(video, sx, sy, sw, sh, 0, 0, width, imageHeight);
  texture.needsUpdate = true;
}
```

---

### 7. **Fallback 영상 파일 확인**

**프로젝트 내 영상 파일:**
- `/resource/video/why_video_1.mp4`
- `/resource/video/why_video_2.mp4`
- `/resource/video/why_video_3.mp4`
- `/resource/video/why_video_4.mp4`

**Placeholder 이미지:**
- `/resource/images/placeholder/placeholder.jpg` (WORK_PLACEHOLDER_IMAGE 상수)

**결론:** Works 그리드/scatter용 전용 fallback 비디오는 **없음**. 이미지 로드 실패 시에만 placeholder.jpg 사용.

---

## 요약

| 항목 | Grid 뷰 | Scatter 뷰 |
|------|---------|-----------|
| **비디오 로드** | `pointerenter` 시 lazy load | hover 감지 시 lazy load |
| **Crossfade** | CSS `.is-video-active` 클래스 (0.35s ease opacity) | Canvas texture overlay + lerp alpha (0.12 inertia) |
| **재생 제어** | HTML5 `<video>` play/pause | JS `_video.play()` / `_video.pause()` |
| **Fallback** | 이미지 로드만 지원 | Canvas render 시 staticImage 있으면 사용, 없으면 new Image() |
| **비디오 fallback** | 없음 (썸네일 이미지만) | 없음 (정적 이미지로 복귀) |

**핵심 흐름:**
1. **HTML 마크업** — `<figure>` 내 `<img>` + `<video>` (preload="none")
2. **Lazy load** — pointerenter 시점에 URL 주입 및 load()
3. **Promise 관리** — play() 비동기 완료 추적 (pendingPlay)
4. **Crossfade** — CSS 클래스 또는 Canvas globalAlpha로 smooth transition
5. **Cleanup** — 모든 이벤트 리스너를 배열 추적하여 dispose 시 정리
